# Android signing material. This repository is public: a committed keystore
# lets anyone sign a release as this developer, and git history keeps it
# forever even after a delete. Keep these offline and pass them to CI as
# encrypted secrets instead.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
key.properties
*.p12
*.pepk
google-services.json
play-service-account*.json
